# Per-Dockerfile BuildKit ignore for `docker build -f api/Dockerfile .`.
#
# BuildKit prefers `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` over the root `.dockerignore`
# when it exists — which is the whole point: the root file excludes `api`
# WHOLESALE (it is tuned for the web image), so building the api image from the
# repo root with that file yields an empty api/ and every COPY fails.
#
# Keep this list additive-safe: the api image needs api/ (minus build output),
# design/ and nothing else.
.git
.claude
.github
.beads
.turbo
.paperflow

# Elixir build output / fetched deps — rebuilt inside the image.
api/_build
api/deps
api/priv/static/cache_manifest.json

# Out-of-scope subtrees for the api image.
js
web
cloud
# api/Dockerfile COPYs cloud/priv/secret-scrub.exs — the ONE secret-pattern set
# both apps compile (Sites.BuildLogScrub / BarkparkCloud.FailureCopy). Same trap
# as tooling/pds below: the blanket `cloud` hides it from the context and the
# COPY fails with '"/cloud/priv/secret-scrub.exs": not found'. The negation must
# follow the exclusion.
!cloud/priv
!cloud/priv/secret-scrub.exs
tooling
# api/Dockerfile COPYs tooling/pds (e0280b12f, 2026-09-02): the blanket `tooling`
# above hid it from the context and every compose-smoke build failed with
# '"/tooling/pds": not found' for 15 h. Negations must follow the exclusion.
!tooling/pds
docs-site
obsidian_example
IndxData
scaffy

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.beam
**/erl_crash.dump

# Logs, OS junk, local env files.
**/*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.local
**/.env
**/.env.local
